                    initialed by Hoyt. Also addressed to
                        Wieland and Snow.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d63-f2" n="2" xml:id="d63-f2-content">
                <p><ref target="#d59">Document 59</ref>.</p>
            </note>
