            </note>
            <note corresp="#d63-f4" n="4" xml:id="d63-f4-content">
                <p>The date of this conversation has not been determined.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d63-f5" n="5" xml:id="d63-f5-content">
                <p>Wieland wrote in the margin at this point:
                    “I agree on the desirability but doubt it’s possible <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >now</hi>.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
